From: Ravi <ravi@openloopagentics.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 23:54:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 06/18] Draw badges as counted pills rather than a dot

A dot said only "something happened". Read the badge file as a state plus a
count and draw the iOS-style pill: a rounded capsule in the button's top-right
corner with the count in dark type, widening for two digits instead of
shrinking the numeral, and capped at "99+".

Colour still comes from the state, so a pending question and a finished
command remain distinguishable at a glance.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0196XW9vTfjGeWDpHTAmYsws
